[198] ����ر�\r\n[199] ����\r\n[200] �����\r\n[201] ����ر�\r\n[202] ����\r\n[203] ���Ĳ���\r\n[204] ���ԣ����ۣ�\r\n[205] �ر�\r\n[206] ����\r\n[207] ����\r\n[208] �ر�\r\n[209] ����\r\n[210] ����\r\n[211] �ر�\r\n[212] ����\r\n[213] �ο�����\r\n[214] �ο�����\r\n[215] �ر�\r\n[216] ����\r\n[217] ��¼\r\n[218] ��¼\r\n[219] ����ر�\r\n[220] ����\r\n[221] ����\r\n[222] ����\r\n[223] ��ѡ\r\n[224] �ṩ���ݵļ�����Ϣ\r\n[225] ��β����\r\n[226] ���߼���\r\n[227] ��ѡ\r\n[228] �ṩ����������Ϣ\r\n[229] ����\r\n[230] ��ѡ\r\n[231] �ṩ����������Ϣ\r\n[232] ��  л\r\n[233] ��ע��һ�����⣬�Ӵ֣����ź����֣�����ΪС�ĺ����壬1.5���оࣻ����һҳ��","cwd":"C:\\Users\\zhang\\.openclaw\\workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775190247486}}
{"type":"message","id":"2ab147c7","parentId":"f8bd6aad","timestamp":"2026-04-03T04:24:21.356Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The encoding is still garbled even when extracting the XML. This seems like a WPS-specific encoding issue. Let me try a different approach - let me copy the files to the workspace and use LibreOffice or try to extract more info.\n\nActually, looking at the XML more closely, I can see things like \"Times New Roman\" which suggests the document is a Chinese academic thesis format document. The garbled text appears to be using a special WPS Office encoding.\n\nLet me try to read the raw bytes and figure out the encoding, or just use the fact that I can see structure like:\n- `[0]` seems to be \"论文格式\" based on context\n- It has sections like \"摘要\", \"Abstract\", \"目录\", \"1 绪论\", etc.\n\nActually, looking at what I can see:\n- Format template document has sections about 论文格式 requirements\n- It's a Chinese academic thesis format guide\n\nLet me now read the paper document to understand what needs to be reformatted.","thinkingSignature":"465028b29584a3c41e2917a8b01ae4088cb02f9afcf6c77f261a5b1f31861374"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_uuql4w9qd932_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"C:\\Users\\zhang\\AppData\\Local\\Programs\\Python\\Python313\\python.exe -c \"\nimport zipfile\nimport xml.etree.ElementTree as ET\n\ndef get_docx_text(path):\n    ns = {'w': 'http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main'}\n    with zipfile.ZipFile(path, 'r') as z:\n        with z.open('word/document.xml') as f:\n            tree = ET.parse(f)\n    root = tree.getroot()\n    paragraphs = []\n    for p in root.iter('{http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main}p'):\n        texts = []\n        for t in p.iter('{http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main}t'):\n            if t.text:\n                texts.append(t.text)\n        if texts:\n            paragraphs.append(''.join(texts))\n    return paragraphs\n\n# Read paper\npaper_paras = get_docx_text(r'C:\\Users\\zhang\\.openclaw\\media\\outbound\\a19e512c-d66e-4706-b4cb-d5417c439e20.docx')\nprint('=== PAPER ===')\nfor i, p in enumerate(paper_paras):\n    print(f'[{i}] {p}')\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":24902,"output":498,"cacheRead":32834,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":58234,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775190247489,"responseId":"061e73e655609af726274a88ae125d2e"}}
{"type":"message","id":"4a6e7c4e","parentId":"2ab147c7","timestamp":"2026-04-03T04:24:21.660Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_uuql4w9qd932_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Traceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"<string>\", line 25, in <module>\r\n    print(f'[{i}] {p}')\r\n    ~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\r\nUnicodeEncodeError: 'gbk' codec can't encode character '\\u2022' in position 26: illegal multibyte sequence\r\n=== PAPER ===\r\n[0] ����1.�������ĿƼ�ѧԺ���Ʊ�ҵ���ģ���ƣ�����ģ��\r\n[1] ����Ҫ��\r\n[2] 1.ѧλ���ĵ�����Ӧ������׼ȷ��\r\n[3] 2.ѧλ����Ӧ������Ϊ��Ҫ׫д����,���ù���Ժ�����ġ�ͨ�ù淶���ֱ����Ĺ淶���ֱ�д,������Ӧ����GB/T15834�Ĺ涨����ѧ����Ϊ�����,�ɲ�������׫д,��Ӧ����������������ժҪ��\r\n[4] 3.ѧλ�����в��õ�������š�������ȫ����Ӧͳһ,�����Ϲ淶��Ҫ�󡣿�ѧ�������ʵ�ʹ��Ӧ����CY/T119�Ĺ涨��������ʹ��רҵ������Դ�Ӧ���״γ���ʱ����ע�ͣ�����רҵ����,���Դ�,Ӧ���״γ��ֵ����ĺ���Բ����ע��ԭ����ȫ�ơ�\r\n[5] 4.ѧλ�����е������÷�Ӧ����GB/T15835�Ĺ涨,��ʶ���ں�ʱ�������Ӧ����GB/T7408.1����ع涨��\r\n[6] 5.ѧλ�����еļ�����λӦ���ù��ҷ����ļ�����λ,ʹ�õ����͵�λ�����ơ����š���д����Ӧ����GB3100,GB/T3101��GB/T3102(���в���)�Ĺ涨��\r\n[7] 6.�˱�ҵ����ģ������л����񹲺͹����ұ�׼GB/T7713.1-2025�޶���ԭ���ϲ����޸ģ���ɾ����ע��ֱ��ʹ�á����ڲ��ʺϴ�ģ��ı�ҵ���ģ����ѧԺ��ϵ��������޸�������µ�ģ�屨�������񴦡�\r\n[8] 7.��ҵ������Ŀһ�㲻�˳���25�֣����������ݲ�ζ࣬���Լ�ʱ���ɲ����������͸��������ϵķ��������и���������͡��޶��򲹳������������á�\r\n[9] 8.��ע�͵�Ҫ�����ڽ�ע��˵��������ע�����ɾ����\r\n[10] 9.ѧʿѧλ����˫���ӡ������ҳ���м�����ҳ�룬ҳ�����������֣�I��II��II������ʽ��ժҪҳ��ʼ�������룬�԰��������֣�1��2��3������ʽ������ҳ��ʼ�������롣\r\n[11] 10.��ҵ���Ĳ��ù���A4ֽ��210mm��297mm��ҳ�棬ֽ�ŵ�����Ӧ����հױ�Ե,�Ա���װ������ӡ����ע��ֽ��ҳ�߾�涨����30mm����25mm����25mm����20mm��ҳüҳ�Ź涨:ҳü20mm��ҳ��15mm��\r\n[12] ��ͼ�����                                                   ѧУ����         \r\n[13] UDC�����                                                  ��    ��         \r\n[14] ���Ʊ�ҵ���ģ���ƣ�\r\n[15] ����    Ŀ��\r\n[16] ѧ��������   ������                  \r\n[17] ѧ    �ţ�   2022050101111        \r\n[18] ָ����ʦ��         ְ�ƣ�      \r\n[19] ѧ��רҵ��                     \r\n[20] רҵ���룺                     \r\n[21] �о�����                     \r\n[22] ����ѧλ��                     \r\n[23] ������λ��                     \r\n[24] �й������ݡ�������\r\n[25] XXX��XX��ԭ��������\r\n[26] ���˵ı�ҵ���ģ���ƣ����ڹ������ĿƼ�ѧԺ��ѧ�����Ŵ���ѧԺѧԺʯ��ͮ��ʦ��ָ���¶���׫д����ɵġ���ҵ���ģ���ƣ�û�����ԡ���Ϯ����ٵ�Υ��ѧ�����¡�ѧ���淶����Ȩ��Ϊ���������Ѿ�ע�����õ������⣬�����ģ���ƣ������κ��������˻����Ѿ�������׫д������Ʒ��ɹ����Ա��ĵ��о�������Ҫ���׵ĸ��˺ͼ��壬��������������ȷ��ʽ������\r\n[27] �����ģ���ƣ��������о��ɹ���������ĿƼ�ѧԺ����������λ�����С����跢���о��ɹ�����������ר���򿪷���Ʒ�����������õ�ʦͬ���ѧԺ�Ͽɡ�\r\n[28] �������ķ��ɺ���ɱ��˳е���\r\n[29]                ��������ǩ����          \r\n[30] 20**��**��**��\n\n(Command exited with code 1)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":1,"durationMs":299,"aggregated":"Traceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"<string>\", line 25, in <module>\r\n    print(f'[{i}] {p}')\r\n    ~~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\r\nUnicodeEncodeError: 'gbk' codec can't encode character '\\u2022' in position 26: illegal multibyte sequence\r\n=== PAPER ===\r\n[0] ����1.�������ĿƼ�ѧԺ���Ʊ�ҵ���ģ���ƣ�����ģ��\r\n[1] ����Ҫ��\r\n[2] 1.ѧλ���ĵ�����Ӧ������׼ȷ��\r\n[3] 2.ѧλ����Ӧ������Ϊ��Ҫ׫д����,���ù���Ժ�����ġ�ͨ�ù淶���ֱ����Ĺ淶���ֱ�д,������Ӧ����GB/T15834�Ĺ涨����ѧ����Ϊ�����,�ɲ�������׫д,��Ӧ����������������ժҪ��\r\n[4] 3.ѧλ�����в��õ�������š�������ȫ����Ӧͳһ,�����Ϲ淶��Ҫ�󡣿�ѧ�������ʵ�ʹ��Ӧ����CY/T119�Ĺ涨��������ʹ��רҵ������Դ�Ӧ���״γ���ʱ����ע�ͣ�����רҵ����,���Դ�,Ӧ���״γ��ֵ����ĺ���Բ����ע��ԭ����ȫ�ơ�\r\n[5] 4.ѧλ�����е������÷�Ӧ����GB/T15835�Ĺ涨,��ʶ���ں�ʱ�������Ӧ����GB/T7408.1����ع涨��\r\n[6] 5.ѧλ�����еļ�����λӦ���ù��ҷ����ļ�����λ,ʹ�õ����͵�λ�����ơ����š���д����Ӧ����GB3100,GB/T3101��GB/T3102(���в���)�Ĺ涨��\r\n[7] 6.�˱�ҵ����ģ������л����񹲺͹����ұ�׼GB/T7713.1-2025�޶���ԭ���ϲ����޸ģ���ɾ����ע��ֱ��ʹ�á����ڲ��ʺϴ�ģ��ı�ҵ���ģ����ѧԺ��ϵ��������޸�������µ�ģ�屨�������񴦡�\r\n[8] 7.��ҵ������Ŀһ�㲻�˳���25�֣����������ݲ�ζ࣬���Լ�ʱ���ɲ����������͸��������ϵķ��������и���������͡��޶��򲹳�����������