{"type":"message","id":"cc703909","parentId":"ca859fba","timestamp":"2026-04-03T04:26:39.673Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the current page setup:\n- w:top=\"1701\" (about 30mm ≈ 1191 dxa... let me calculate: 1 inch = 1440 dxa, 1 mm = 1440/25.4 ≈ 56.7 dxa, so 30mm = 1701 dxa ✓)\n- w:right=\"1134\" (about 20mm... 20*56.7=1134 ✓)\n- w:bottom=\"1417\" (about 25mm... 25*56.7=1417.5 ✓)\n\n\n- w:left=\"1417\" (about 25mm... 25*56.7=1417.5 ✓)\n- w:header=\"1134\" (about 20mm... 20*56.7=1134 ✓)\n- w:footer=\"850\" (about 15mm... 15*56.7=850.5 ✓)\n\nThe template requires precise margins: top 30mm, bottom 25mm, left 25mm, right 20mm, with header at 20mm and footer at 15mm. Let me verify the conversion: 1mm equals approximately 56.7 dxa, so top should be 30mm × 56.7 = 1701 dxa, right should be 20mm × 56.7 = 1134 dxa, bottom should be 25mm × 56.7 = 1417.5 dxa (rounds to 1418), and left should be 25mm × 56.7 = 1417.5 dxa (rounds to 1418).\n\nThe footer calculation gives 850.5 dxa which rounds to 851, and I need to check the footer value against the standard. Looking at the style definitions will help me understand what font sizes like \"四号\" and \"小三号\" actually represent in the document's XML structure.","thinkingSignature":"fcad10080d6d8403aba3ff65577c35a43c853939a0319d1cb862427141524ee7"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_bz0bngnvjzjt_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"C:\\Users\\zhang\\AppData\\Local\\Programs\\Python\\Python313\\python.exe -c \"\nimport zipfile\n\npath = r'C:\\Users\\zhang\\.openclaw\\media\\outbound\\a19e512c-d66e-4706-b4cb-d5417c439e20.docx'\nwith zipfile.ZipFile(path, 'r') as z:\n    # Read styles.xml\n    with z.open('word/styles.xml') as f:\n        content = f.read().decode('utf-8')\n    print(content[:8000])\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":45367,"output":553,"cacheRead":32834,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":78754,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775190387657,"responseId":"061e7472d0fb1ffabc2741cabfa08b2c"}}
